This MIT license covers code authored for this project. The repository
additionally bundles third-party assets which retain their own licenses:

- Inter font (public/fonts/Inter-*.ttf and the subset baked into public/fonts.css)
  — SIL Open Font License 1.1 — see https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Inter
- Brand logo SVGs (public/logos/*.svg) — sourced from Wikimedia Commons and
  simple-icons (https://simpleicons.org/, CC0). The logos themselves remain
  trademarks of their respective owners and are used here for the personal
  purpose of compositing photo metadata onto user-supplied images.
- Vendored libraries (public/vendor/) retain their upstream licenses:
  exifr (MIT), piexifjs (MIT), JSZip (MIT/GPL), libheif-js (LGPL), Leaflet
  (BSD-2-Clause), aws4fetch (MIT).
